1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,295
A loaf sells for $6 by day.

2
00:00:02,310 --> 00:00:03,915
At night, suddenly half price!

3
00:00:03,930 --> 00:00:05,080
Just $3!

4
00:00:05,130 --> 00:00:07,335
Doesn't the bakery lose money?

5
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:09,100
Here is the business concept.

6
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:12,340
Perishable Inventory

7
00:00:12,630 --> 00:00:13,995
For some goods, after today,

8
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:15,580
it may be too late to sell.

9
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:17,355
All figures are hypothetical.

10
00:00:17,370 --> 00:00:18,315
Imagine a bakery.

11
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:20,080
It has 50 loaves left at night.

12
00:00:20,190 --> 00:00:22,060
Each loaf costs $2 to make.

13
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:23,475
If they do not sell today,

14
00:00:23,490 --> 00:00:25,000
they must be discarded tomorrow.

15
00:00:25,170 --> 00:00:27,555
Half price now: $3 each.

16
00:00:27,570 --> 00:00:29,235
Assume all 50 loaves sell.

17
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:31,240
That brings in $150 in revenue!

18
00:00:31,470 --> 00:00:33,375
If none sell and all are discarded,

19
00:00:33,390 --> 00:00:34,840
sales revenue is zero.

20
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:35,860
Wait a moment.

21
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:37,575
Each loaf costs $2 to make.

22
00:00:37,590 --> 00:00:38,895
Now it sells for just $3.

23
00:00:38,910 --> 00:00:40,120
Isn't that less profit?

24
00:00:40,230 --> 00:00:40,720
Yes.

25
00:00:40,890 --> 00:00:42,555
But if it does not sell today,

26
00:00:42,570 --> 00:00:44,020
it gets thrown away tomorrow.

27
00:00:44,190 --> 00:00:45,855
Rather than recover nothing,

28
00:00:45,870 --> 00:00:47,115
reduce the price now

29
00:00:47,130 --> 00:00:48,760
and keep losses down.

30
00:00:49,290 --> 00:00:52,035
For goods discarded if unsold today,

31
00:00:52,050 --> 00:00:53,980
a timely discount may make sense.

32
00:00:54,210 --> 00:00:54,795
Remember:

33
00:00:54,810 --> 00:00:56,115
Unsold inventory

34
00:00:56,130 --> 00:00:57,100
has a cost too.

35
00:00:57,210 --> 00:00:59,080
This is Business Through Data.
